<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Homeside started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Homeside started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it initiated coverage of HomeSide Inc as a near, long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- HomeSide gained 3/8 to 17-7/8 in early morning trading.</p>
</text>
